        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository be05317a-3d16-4b41-bede-ff99e126c157).Image",
        "Description": "We always look into the distance, and too rarely around us. Like a thunderbolt it hits us and our dearest ones.\rBad events can divide couples. And Gama can not put everything back together.\rBut not all fractures only hurt, some are a new side of the puzzle piece. And if you allow it, it can merge with a new partner. Do not force it though, because what can not grow together will continue to tear.",
